{"title":"Transporter","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><p>Let <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/d/1/5d1e4485dc90c450e8c76826516c1b2ccb8fce16.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$M$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"21\" height=\"14\" /> be a <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Monoid\" title=\"Monoid\">monoid</a> operating on a <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Set\" title=\"Set\">set</a> <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/d/2/ad28c83c99a8fd0dd2e2e594c9d02ee532765a0a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$S$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" />, and let <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/1/9/019e9892786e493964e145e7c5cf7b700314e53b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$A$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"15\" height=\"14\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/f/5/ff5fb3d775862e2123b007eb4373ff6cc1a34d4e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$B$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"17\" height=\"14\" /> be <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Subset\" title=\"Subset\">subsets</a> of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/d/2/ad28c83c99a8fd0dd2e2e594c9d02ee532765a0a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$S$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" />.  Then the <i>transporter</i> of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/1/9/019e9892786e493964e145e7c5cf7b700314e53b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$A$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"15\" height=\"14\" /> to <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/f/5/ff5fb3d775862e2123b007eb4373ff6cc1a34d4e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$B$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"17\" height=\"14\" /> is the set of elements <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/2/1/d21d2095d5d0dc2fdcfd8c8a3d10015c0746b2e0.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a\\in M$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"51\" height=\"13\" /> for which <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/c/1/2c1b8a5ed4320fd87ae7fab2ad225dd1cabae9b6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a(A) \\subseteq B$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"75\" height=\"18\" />.  The <i>strict transporter</i> of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/1/9/019e9892786e493964e145e7c5cf7b700314e53b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$A$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"15\" height=\"14\" /> to <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/f/5/ff5fb3d775862e2123b007eb4373ff6cc1a34d4e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$B$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"17\" height=\"14\" /> is the set of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/2/1/d21d2095d5d0dc2fdcfd8c8a3d10015c0746b2e0.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a\\in M$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"51\" height=\"13\" /> for which <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/b/f/2bfed88af5c9ad1ddb31e87df42dde8715c6634b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a(A) = B$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"75\" height=\"18\" />.  The transporter of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/1/9/019e9892786e493964e145e7c5cf7b700314e53b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$A$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"15\" height=\"14\" /> to itself is called the <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Stabilizer\" title=\"Stabilizer\">stabilizer</a> of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/1/9/019e9892786e493964e145e7c5cf7b700314e53b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$A$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"15\" height=\"14\" />.\n</p><p><i>This article is a stub.  Help us out by <span class=\"plainlinks\"><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://artofproblemsolving.com/wiki/index.php?title=Transporter&amp;action=edit\">expanding it</a></span>.</i>\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Sources\">Sources</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Transporter&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Sources\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>N. Bourbaki, <i>Algebra I</i>, Springer, ISBN 3-540-64243-9 .\n</p>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20261017121133\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: []\nCPU time usage: 0.011 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.016 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 90/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 274/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 0/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 4/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 2597/5000000 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%    6.744      1 Template:Stub\n100.00%    6.744      1 -total\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key wiki-wiki_:pcache:6894:|#|:idhash:canonical and timestamp 20261017121133 and revision id 25993. Rendering was triggered because: page-view\n -->\n</div>"}